WEBVTT

00:02.820 --> 00:05.060
Since I lost,

00:05.060 --> 00:07.740
whatever happens to me is up to you guys.

00:08.480 --> 00:09.290
That's fine.

00:11.440 --> 00:13.760
I'm cool with everything.

00:14.640 --> 00:15.780
Sweet!

00:15.780 --> 00:17.840
Then, I won't hold ba—

00:19.420 --> 00:22.790
I heard that you betrayed us before!

00:22.790 --> 00:26.390
I haven't forgotten that you 
laid hands on Yukito-san!

00:26.390 --> 00:28.430
Why don't we make you pay with your life?!

00:28.430 --> 00:30.260
Don't you have anything to say?!

00:28.430 --> 00:30.260
We only ask for one thing:

00:30.600 --> 00:33.350
Send word to all of your followers.

00:34.070 --> 00:37.150
That from now on, they are to worship 
Mitama as god and to submit to her.

00:37.550 --> 00:39.340
Won't do it.

00:40.780 --> 00:43.320
What did you say, you snotty fake brat?!

00:41.440 --> 00:42.220
There, there.

00:43.320 --> 00:44.430
I'll give you some time.

00:44.950 --> 00:47.460
But if you won't do as we say,

00:49.780 --> 00:52.260
we'll just have to get rid of you.

00:58.030 --> 01:03.040
Episode 9
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
Your perfectly pur-

01:03.580 --> 01:05.330
<i>If they kill me,</i>

01:05.330 --> 01:09.750
<i>my 10,000 plus followers will be 
scattered so they can't absorb them.</i>

01:09.750 --> 01:11.210
<i>There's still a chance...</i>

01:14.380 --> 01:15.340
Riche?

01:16.220 --> 01:17.840
What are you doing here?

01:18.260 --> 01:19.390
Aw, man.

01:19.390 --> 01:23.430
I thought you would understand since 
you're Touka's daughter and all...

01:26.520 --> 01:28.810
Were you close to my mother?

01:29.480 --> 01:31.820
Yes, we were best friends.

01:31.820 --> 01:34.110
I loved Touka.

01:34.110 --> 01:37.610
That's why I wanted to change 
the world that killed her.

01:39.240 --> 01:43.450
I don't know exactly what happened 
between you and my mother.

01:43.450 --> 01:44.330
However,

01:44.910 --> 01:47.460
if your actions were for 
the benefit of my mother,

01:47.790 --> 01:48.960
then as her daughter,

01:48.960 --> 01:51.210
it's only natural for me to take your side.

01:52.250 --> 01:55.460
I didn't dislike you before, either.

01:57.220 --> 01:58.430
Riche-tan...

01:58.430 --> 02:00.470
Please give me a bit of time.

02:00.470 --> 02:05.390
I'll go convince that man so you can 
continue your work with our group.

02:05.390 --> 02:07.100
Huh? What do yo—

02:07.100 --> 02:08.350
Riche-tan?

02:09.730 --> 02:11.610
I did it, Dakini-sama!

02:15.480 --> 02:16.580
Oink.

02:16.580 --> 02:17.570
Oink.

02:18.110 --> 02:19.220
Oink!

02:19.220 --> 02:20.610
Oink!

02:20.610 --> 02:22.700
I was able to convince him!

02:24.490 --> 02:25.950
Oink.

02:29.870 --> 02:31.250
Oink!

02:32.420 --> 02:33.710
Stand up, damn it!

02:33.710 --> 02:35.340
Oink!

02:35.340 --> 02:37.340
Hey, Mr. Piggy,

02:37.340 --> 02:40.130
aren't you embarrassed to 
wear something like this?

02:40.130 --> 02:42.050
I am embarrassed, oink.

02:42.050 --> 02:43.430
But in reality?

02:43.430 --> 02:46.140
I want to be punished more, oink.

02:46.850 --> 02:50.270
Riche-tan is good to get 
this far in so little time.

02:46.850 --> 02:50.270
How do you want to be punished?

02:50.270 --> 02:51.480
My n-n-nipples.

02:51.480 --> 02:56.150
Wasn't there something you needed 
to say to Dakini-sama first?

02:56.480 --> 02:57.320
Yes.

02:58.190 --> 03:03.620
Dakini-sama, I won't interfere 
with your activities anymore.

03:04.030 --> 03:05.280
Good boy.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.910
Well said.

03:06.910 --> 03:08.160
But...

03:08.160 --> 03:10.500
I told you to end your 
sentences with oink, you pig!

03:10.500 --> 03:12.540
Oink!

03:12.540 --> 03:13.630
Now, come!

03:13.630 --> 03:16.840
Squirt your pathetic cummies all 
over in front of Dakini-sama!

03:16.840 --> 03:18.300
Now, come!

03:16.840 --> 03:20.300
Oink, oink, oink!

03:18.300 --> 03:20.300
Come all over!

03:20.300 --> 03:23.890
Oooiiiiink!

03:23.890 --> 03:25.390
Dakini-sama!

03:25.390 --> 03:28.680
Now there's nobody left who 
can interfere with our work!

03:28.680 --> 03:32.730
Let's keep spreading our 
kind of love all over!

03:32.730 --> 03:34.230
My kind of slut!

03:34.230 --> 03:35.610
Dakini-sama,

03:35.610 --> 03:38.940
would you consider entrusting 
me with this organization?

03:38.940 --> 03:40.440
What do you mean?

03:40.440 --> 03:43.700
Our organization is split between 
the people who follow me,

03:43.700 --> 03:45.870
and those who follow you.

03:45.870 --> 03:48.200
I would like to bring those 
back together again.

03:48.200 --> 03:51.750
Please trust me as the daughter 
of your best friend!

03:52.920 --> 03:54.250
Riche-tan...

03:54.250 --> 03:55.750
Sure!

03:55.750 --> 03:59.550
I mean, we're connected by an erotic 
bond that spans generations!

03:59.550 --> 04:01.920
Yes, thank you so much!

04:02.300 --> 04:04.380
Now, let's shove this into him.

04:03.090 --> 04:05.680
Hah, you're crazy!

04:05.680 --> 04:08.640
<i>What the hell is an "erotic bond"...</i>

04:08.640 --> 04:11.310
So, what to do with Dakini...

04:11.310 --> 04:13.980
Let's just kill the brat already.

04:13.980 --> 04:18.110
Anyone who can get in Yukito's 
way should be eliminated!

04:18.110 --> 04:19.020
No,

04:19.020 --> 04:20.940
I'd like to absorb followers 
of that magnitude.

04:20.940 --> 04:22.900
The one who can do that is...

04:22.900 --> 04:24.320
Huh? Me?

04:24.320 --> 04:25.070
Yes.

04:25.570 --> 04:27.700
You have a close relationship to Dakini.

04:28.240 --> 04:31.450
For instance, if we were able 
to bring over her followers

04:31.450 --> 04:34.210
to the Riche faction under favorable 
conditions for Dakini...

04:34.210 --> 04:35.500
I see.

04:35.500 --> 04:37.580
In that case, I know of a good way.

04:41.170 --> 04:45.050
Now I'm going to prepare <i>your</i> body!

04:45.050 --> 04:47.430
Uh, I don't think this 
is really necessary...

04:47.430 --> 04:49.470
What are you?

04:49.470 --> 04:50.310
Huh?

04:50.310 --> 04:53.560
You are a "disgusting pig".

04:53.560 --> 04:54.980
How the hell did you forget?!

04:55.520 --> 04:58.020
And pigs say oink!

04:58.020 --> 04:58.980
Oink!

04:58.980 --> 05:00.690
Say it from the gut!

05:00.690 --> 05:02.070
O-Oink...

05:02.070 --> 05:05.570
Do you really think you can fool 
Dakini-sama with that kind of acting?!

05:07.070 --> 05:11.290
You're allowed to throw ash 
trays at bad actors, right?

05:11.290 --> 05:14.000
Uh, no, that was just something they 
did in the country I'm from...

05:14.000 --> 05:17.460
Come on! Show me the best 
acting you have in you!

05:18.210 --> 05:21.380
Al-san, Sil-san, would you 
lend me a hand, as well?

05:21.380 --> 05:22.250
Yes!

05:22.250 --> 05:23.590
Of course!

05:23.590 --> 05:25.220
We'll help!

05:25.920 --> 05:29.180
Then let's domesticate this piggy together.

05:29.180 --> 05:30.430
Yes!

05:30.430 --> 05:31.010
Huh?

05:32.390 --> 05:34.350
This is kind of fun.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.810
I'm sorry, Yukito-san!

05:36.810 --> 05:38.980
But I can't resist my curiosity!

05:38.980 --> 05:41.110
Hey! You guys!

05:41.110 --> 05:41.980
Stop—

05:41.110 --> 05:41.980
Take it!

05:41.980 --> 05:42.900
Oink!

05:42.900 --> 05:44.190
Oink!

05:44.860 --> 05:47.900
Nice, nice!

05:46.740 --> 05:47.900
Stop!

05:47.900 --> 05:49.160
Awesome!

05:52.660 --> 05:54.160
Even though I was acting,

05:54.160 --> 05:55.790
I don't want to remember that anymore.

05:55.790 --> 05:59.500
Hmm, it was so convincing I 
can't believe it was acting.

05:59.500 --> 06:04.250
I am prepared for anything you 
might be into, Yukito-san.

06:05.800 --> 06:10.590
Anyway, we can probably safely leave the 
operation of the Dakini faith to those two.

06:10.590 --> 06:12.300
Look, Yukito, look!

06:12.300 --> 06:14.260
I've gained so many followers!

06:14.260 --> 06:16.020
It's over 10,000!

06:17.730 --> 06:21.310
As a result, that organization was 
consolidated under the Riche faction.

06:21.310 --> 06:24.360
Since Riche worships Mitama as her god,

06:24.360 --> 06:27.150
we were able to absorb all 
those followers completely.

06:27.150 --> 06:29.490
I see.

06:29.950 --> 06:35.240
<i>Dakini might have figured out 
what we were planning all along.</i>

06:35.740 --> 06:39.500
<i>But she probably still went along 
with our dumb act just for Riche.</i>

06:40.040 --> 06:41.250
<i>With that said,</i>

06:41.250 --> 06:45.630
<i>the emotions of the archons are 
easier to read than this one's.</i>

06:45.630 --> 06:49.090
You see that? 
10,000 people. 10,000!

06:49.090 --> 06:49.880
Shut up.

06:49.880 --> 06:51.720
We're almost to the village.

06:52.510 --> 06:53.970
A strange beast!

06:54.760 --> 06:56.810
I have over 10,000 followers!

06:57.270 --> 06:59.560
I will show you the power 
of the one and only,

06:59.560 --> 07:02.690
absolutely strongest and best god!

07:02.690 --> 07:03.900
Pew.

07:04.650 --> 07:05.940
Oh, Atar...

07:05.940 --> 07:08.110
How dare you?! That was my time to shine!

07:09.690 --> 07:12.530
11,777?!

07:12.530 --> 07:15.580
Why do you have more 
followers than me again?!

07:15.580 --> 07:16.370
I don't know.

07:16.370 --> 07:18.700
But if I have this much power,

07:18.700 --> 07:20.330
I won't lose to anyone.

07:20.330 --> 07:22.210
I will rebuild the Empire!

07:22.210 --> 07:23.960
Oh, more strange beasts!

07:22.210 --> 07:32.380
<b>Monsters have appeared!</b>

07:22.210 --> 07:32.380
<b>Strange Beasts</b>

07:22.210 --> 07:32.380
<b>Fight
Mitama
Item
Run</b>

07:22.210 --> 07:32.380
<b>Yukito
Roy
Al & Sil
Atar</b>

07:23.960 --> 07:24.840
No problem.

07:24.840 --> 07:25.960
I'll defeat them.

07:25.960 --> 07:27.300
There's so many of them!

07:27.300 --> 07:29.010
No matter how many come, it's no problem.

07:29.010 --> 07:30.920
They keep coming!

07:30.920 --> 07:33.010
It doesn't matter how 
many come, it's no pro—

07:34.590 --> 07:35.680
Problem...

07:36.180 --> 07:38.100
We have a problem.

07:39.270 --> 07:42.230
What is going on here?!

07:47.860 --> 07:48.730
One...

07:48.730 --> 07:50.280
more shot!

07:51.320 --> 07:52.150
Crap!

08:04.250 --> 08:06.670
That was in the nick of time.

08:06.670 --> 08:09.090
Saved by Mitama-chan again.

08:09.090 --> 08:11.130
You see, you little brat?

08:11.130 --> 08:13.550
Can you do something like that?

08:14.260 --> 08:16.090
I was only saving Yukito,

08:16.090 --> 08:17.850
but you also survived, thanks to me.

08:17.850 --> 08:19.390
You better be grateful.

08:19.390 --> 08:21.310
You're right. Thank you.

08:21.310 --> 08:21.980
Huh?

08:21.980 --> 08:22.560
Yes.

08:22.560 --> 08:27.940
I-I guess you're also realizing that 
you're one of my followers, huh?

08:27.940 --> 08:29.070
I'm not a follower.

08:29.610 --> 08:30.730
This is bad!

08:31.780 --> 08:33.070
That direction...

08:33.860 --> 08:35.320
Our village!

08:36.490 --> 08:37.780
This is...

08:41.620 --> 08:42.580
Where are the villagers?

08:42.580 --> 08:43.660
Hey!

08:44.500 --> 08:45.290
Ricky!

08:45.290 --> 08:46.420
You guys!

08:45.290 --> 08:46.420
Hey!

08:46.420 --> 08:47.790
You're safe!

08:47.790 --> 08:49.090
Yeah.

08:49.090 --> 08:52.260
We had picked out a place 
to hide with Sil before.

08:52.260 --> 08:54.930
I see. I'm glad...

08:56.430 --> 08:57.550
But...

08:58.220 --> 09:00.310
as you can see, the village is ruined.

09:05.060 --> 09:07.100
Our eatery...

09:07.560 --> 09:09.730
It's not so bad.

09:09.730 --> 09:11.400
We'll manage somehow.

09:12.070 --> 09:13.400
You're right.

09:13.400 --> 09:14.740
As long as we're alive,

09:14.740 --> 09:17.320
we can rebuild our place, too.

09:17.320 --> 09:19.700
Can we have ice cream again?

09:20.160 --> 09:22.370
We won't be able to reopen for a while.

09:22.370 --> 09:23.250
What?

09:24.540 --> 09:29.000
You're so happy to have your god back, huh?

09:27.330 --> 09:29.000
Mitama, I have a favor to ask.

09:29.000 --> 09:29.960
What is it, Yukito?

09:30.500 --> 09:34.050
Please restore the village 
to how it was before.

09:34.670 --> 09:35.590
No.

09:35.970 --> 09:38.840
With the amount of followers you have, 
it should be possible, right?

09:38.840 --> 09:39.840
I don't wanna.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.430
Please, Mitama!

09:41.430 --> 09:42.930
B-But...

09:42.930 --> 09:44.430
if I repair everything,

09:44.430 --> 09:46.940
I'll lose my powers again...

09:46.940 --> 09:51.150
<i>I never want to go through 
that sort of thing again...</i>

09:51.150 --> 09:52.770
That's why I'm begging you!

09:51.940 --> 09:53.690
I don't want to!

09:53.690 --> 09:57.570
No way, I don't want to do it!

09:54.570 --> 09:56.030
I'm begging you as well.

09:56.030 --> 09:57.570
Please repair the village.

09:57.570 --> 09:59.030
I said I don't want to do it!

09:59.030 --> 10:01.030
Besides, why do I even 
have to listen to you—

10:01.030 --> 10:03.700
I need your help.

10:04.040 --> 10:04.870
What?

10:05.830 --> 10:06.660
Please.

10:10.540 --> 10:14.050
Mitama, I'm begging you as well.

10:14.050 --> 10:17.090
Our religious group is being 
held together with your power!

10:17.090 --> 10:19.010
Please save our group 
with your divine power!

10:19.010 --> 10:21.050
<b>Siluril: Mitama-chan!</b>

10:19.010 --> 10:21.050
Mitama-chan, if you can do it, please do!

10:21.050 --> 10:22.180
Please!

10:21.050 --> 10:22.180
<b>Alural: Please!</b>

10:22.180 --> 10:23.050
<b>Ricky: Please!</b>

10:22.180 --> 10:23.050
Please!

10:23.390 --> 10:24.430
Mitama-sama!

10:27.980 --> 10:31.230
<i>I need her to maintain our civilization.</i>

10:31.230 --> 10:32.730
<i>Civilization over anything.</i>

10:31.730 --> 10:33.060
<i>If the eatery doesn't come back,</i>

10:32.730 --> 10:34.440
<i>Civilization, civilization...</i>

10:33.060 --> 10:34.440
<i>I can't eat ice cream!</i>

10:34.440 --> 10:35.610
<i>I want ice cream,</i>

10:35.610 --> 10:37.440
<i>ice cream, ice cream...</i>

10:35.610 --> 10:38.530
<i>I want my collection of banned books back!</i>

10:38.530 --> 10:40.570
<i>Banned books, banned books...</i>

10:38.530 --> 10:40.570
<i>I want to drink booze already!</i>

10:40.570 --> 10:43.070
<i>Booze, booze, booze!</i>

10:45.490 --> 10:47.160
I guess I have no choice!

10:47.160 --> 10:52.630
It's the job of a supreme god with 
overwhelming charisma to save their followers!

10:52.630 --> 10:55.840
Your pure pleas have indeed reached my ears!

10:55.840 --> 10:56.760
Pure skies!

10:56.760 --> 10:57.590
Pure earth!

10:57.590 --> 10:59.800
As I am the god of sky and earth,

10:59.800 --> 11:01.510
and as all spirits are one,

11:01.510 --> 11:03.800
no wish cannot be granted by me.

11:03.800 --> 11:06.810
Thus it shall be!

11:12.020 --> 11:13.190
That power...

11:13.190 --> 11:16.980
It's obviously different from 
the powers of us archons.

11:25.030 --> 11:26.330
Amazing...

11:27.660 --> 11:29.750
Well, either way.

11:30.330 --> 11:32.000
Let's crush it.

11:32.330 --> 11:35.170
Now go, my beas—

11:35.170 --> 11:35.750
Ouchie!

11:36.590 --> 11:38.210
Huh? What? Why?

11:38.210 --> 11:41.090
Please! Listen to me!

11:42.180 --> 11:44.840
Someone help!

11:46.570 --> 11:50.870
Let's toast to the restoration of the 
village and the growth of our faith.

11:50.870 --> 11:52.350
Cheers!

11:52.350 --> 11:54.250
Cheers!

11:54.250 --> 11:56.540
Tonight we're going to drink in earnest!

11:57.400 --> 11:59.750
Al! Yeah!

11:59.750 --> 12:02.090
Nice one, Siluril!

12:00.460 --> 12:02.090
Sis...

12:02.090 --> 12:04.410
That's amazing!

12:02.090 --> 12:04.410
Al, you look wonderful wet, too.

12:04.760 --> 12:05.550
Geez!

12:05.550 --> 12:07.050
Stop it, Siluril!

12:07.050 --> 12:08.990
Part of the service!

12:08.990 --> 12:12.310
We managed to somehow get back to 
the previous standard of life.

12:12.310 --> 12:13.980
You saved us, Mitama.

12:13.980 --> 12:16.920
Did I... do well?

12:17.230 --> 12:18.100
Yeah.

12:18.100 --> 12:19.250
You should rest for now.

12:19.810 --> 12:24.220
I guess repairing all of the gadgets that 
were destroyed was understandably exhausting.

12:24.220 --> 12:27.410
Thanks so much, Mitama-chan.

12:28.280 --> 12:29.640
What are you doing?

12:29.640 --> 12:32.370
Yukito, you, too. 
You got so desperate about the village.

12:32.370 --> 12:34.200
I guess you must really care about it!

12:34.200 --> 12:35.410
You sly dog!

12:35.410 --> 12:36.650
That's not all.

12:37.290 --> 12:40.210
Our religious organization isn't 
built on loyalty or charisma.

12:40.210 --> 12:42.050
The followers have just flocked to us

12:40.210 --> 12:43.840
m 0 0 l 500 0 l 500 100 l 0 100

12:40.210 --> 12:43.840
<b>* Atar is eating ice cream.
Atar: Ice cream is yummy!
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hIce cream is yummy!</b>

12:42.050 --> 12:44.170
because of Mitama and Atar 
providing immediate benefits.

12:43.840 --> 12:48.370
m 0 0 l 500 0 l 500 100 l 0 100

12:43.840 --> 12:48.370
<b>* Alural is reading a banned book.
Alural: I see.
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEven Yukito-san might enjoy this one!</b>

12:44.760 --> 12:46.380
So if they lose even a little bit of that,

12:46.380 --> 12:48.370
our followers will scatter 
faster than we can count.

12:48.930 --> 12:52.600
That's why we had no choice but to fully 
restore the village using Mitama's power.

12:52.600 --> 12:53.520
I see.

12:53.520 --> 12:55.020
I don't quite get it all,

12:55.020 --> 12:58.330
but I guess you're thinking 
about complicated stuff, huh?

12:57.190 --> 13:01.060
Hey, did you say I have no charisma?

12:58.330 --> 13:02.340
<i>But that's our religious group's weak point.</i>

13:01.060 --> 13:02.340
Hey...

13:03.020 --> 13:03.860
Yukito!

13:03.860 --> 13:05.470
There's a strange beast again!

13:06.320 --> 13:07.570
Roy's in danger!

13:08.200 --> 13:09.050
Roy?

13:09.050 --> 13:11.490
Oh, Roy.

13:20.920 --> 13:22.860
Just one is no problem.

13:22.860 --> 13:24.650
Roy, are you all right?!

13:24.960 --> 13:28.340
I'm find, but she's hurt bad.

13:28.340 --> 13:31.180
It might be too late if we 
don't treat her right away!

13:31.180 --> 13:32.550
Let's check her wounds!

13:32.550 --> 13:33.850
Time is of the essence!

13:33.850 --> 13:35.620
We have no choice but to remove her clothes!

13:35.620 --> 13:37.810
I'm just removing her clothes 
to inspect the wounds!

13:37.810 --> 13:41.880
I am totally not removing her 
clothes for some uncouth reasons...

13:44.840 --> 13:46.670
I'm sorry.

13:49.400 --> 13:52.810
You're not my type.

13:53.890 --> 13:55.480
Ah!

13:55.480 --> 13:57.290
I'm done for!

13:57.290 --> 14:01.000
The strange beasts got me 
and my body won't move.

14:01.000 --> 14:04.130
If some cutie doesn't come soon...

14:02.290 --> 14:03.040
Yeah, right.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.130
Liar.

14:04.130 --> 14:05.240
...to save me,

14:05.240 --> 14:08.210
I might just die.

14:09.300 --> 14:13.140
Hurry, or else I'll die.

14:11.130 --> 14:13.140
Atar, go take a look, please.

14:13.140 --> 14:14.760
Why me?

14:13.140 --> 14:19.560
A cute girl or a cute boy.

14:14.760 --> 14:15.680
Just check.

14:19.560 --> 14:21.020
Hurry.

14:19.560 --> 14:21.020
Hey, get up.

14:21.020 --> 14:22.440
Judging by the way you moved before,

14:22.440 --> 14:24.310
you're no amateur.

14:24.310 --> 14:26.840
If you harbor any ill will 
towards the village, I'll—

14:43.630 --> 14:46.230
That was so rejuvenating!

14:46.230 --> 14:48.960
Is that the flavor of vanilla ice cream?

14:48.960 --> 14:50.700
<i>What is this woman?</i>

14:50.700 --> 14:53.930
So, who here represents this religious group?

14:54.840 --> 14:56.120
What do you want?

14:56.510 --> 15:01.100
To discuss something important. 
Namely, your future.

15:01.100 --> 15:04.590
You don't want strange beasts to 
destroy your village again, right?

15:04.590 --> 15:07.940
I am Gaia, one of the main archons.

15:07.940 --> 15:10.820
I have the power to control strange beasts.

15:11.530 --> 15:13.530
So here's my suggestion.

15:15.570 --> 15:16.620
Eek!

15:16.620 --> 15:18.520
You can't just throw such a cutie at me.

15:18.520 --> 15:20.040
That's cheating.

15:20.040 --> 15:22.520
Yukito... why...

15:23.040 --> 15:23.870
Ow!

15:25.670 --> 15:29.130
Then, I'll kill you before you 
can call any strange beasts.

15:29.130 --> 15:31.380
Your power is dangerous.

15:32.160 --> 15:33.450
W-Wait!

15:33.450 --> 15:35.130
It was actually an accident!

15:35.130 --> 15:36.620
I mean, that the village got destroyed!

15:39.350 --> 15:39.950
What?

15:41.560 --> 15:42.620
Listen, Yukito!

15:42.930 --> 15:45.440
She only has a piddly two followers!

15:45.440 --> 15:48.360
I have over 10,000!

15:48.360 --> 15:50.150
Oh, wow.

15:48.360 --> 15:52.070
It's um, five times, 50 times...

15:50.480 --> 15:52.070
Wow, that many?

15:52.070 --> 15:54.490
Way more than you!

15:54.490 --> 15:56.660
So, are you jealous?

15:56.660 --> 15:58.950
Yes. That's amazing.

15:56.660 --> 15:58.950
You should respect and worship me.

15:58.950 --> 16:01.790
Amazing, aren't I?

15:58.950 --> 16:05.230
Basically, you're saying you don't have 
enough followers to control the strange beasts?

16:05.670 --> 16:06.670
Yes.

16:06.670 --> 16:09.040
I was attacked myself 
and ended up like this.

16:09.040 --> 16:12.840
The fact that your village was attacked 
was an unfortunate accident as well.

16:13.110 --> 16:15.550
So, what is it that you want?

16:15.550 --> 16:17.640
To crush Loki.

16:21.640 --> 16:26.710
She's the one who started this game 
pitting us archons against each other, right?

16:26.710 --> 16:30.060
She's undoubtedly prepared some way to win.

16:30.060 --> 16:32.440
I went to the capital the other day,

16:32.440 --> 16:34.900
but she's definitely plotting something.

16:34.900 --> 16:37.910
It's dangerous if we don't crush her soon.

16:37.910 --> 16:40.580
Let's defeat Loki together!

16:40.580 --> 16:43.100
I can be useful.

16:46.080 --> 16:49.630
Mitama-chan, can't you 
summon a simpler vehicle?

16:51.000 --> 16:52.670
Mitama-sama!

16:51.000 --> 16:54.990
It's good when there are more people 
who understand my greatness.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.780
Good, good.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.780
It's coming into view!

16:56.780 --> 16:58.590
Is this the capital?

16:58.590 --> 17:01.470
What is that humongous wall?!

17:01.470 --> 17:04.850
That wasn't there the 
last time we were here.

17:05.500 --> 17:07.920
It's incredibly high.

17:08.520 --> 17:10.590
<i>What could this be for?</i>

17:11.440 --> 17:14.220
This kind of wall is no match for my power—

17:14.530 --> 17:16.860
You shouldn't do that.

17:16.860 --> 17:18.720
Wh-Wh-Why not?!

17:19.530 --> 17:22.310
Let's try something.

17:22.910 --> 17:25.080
I'll show you my other power,

17:25.080 --> 17:28.870
creating strange beasts.

17:28.870 --> 17:31.250
So she doesn't just control them.

17:31.250 --> 17:33.130
She can even create strange beasts!

17:33.670 --> 17:35.460
I knew it. She's too dangerou—

17:36.510 --> 17:38.820
That's so cute!

17:38.820 --> 17:42.930
That's all I can manage right now.

17:42.930 --> 17:45.520
I can't move...

17:45.520 --> 17:48.180
Mitama-chan, please let me refuel.

17:48.180 --> 17:49.730
Eek!

17:54.070 --> 17:57.680
As you can see, the moment you 
clear the wall, you're attacked.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.900
<i>This kind of security...</i>

17:59.900 --> 18:01.260
<i>What could be going on inside?</i>

18:04.140 --> 18:06.290
What now?!

18:10.960 --> 18:12.170
What is that?!

18:12.170 --> 18:13.150
No idea.

18:14.790 --> 18:17.610
All who attempt to enter the 
capital will be eliminated.

18:18.510 --> 18:20.720
I, the black knight Bertrand, 
will make sure of that.

18:24.260 --> 18:26.140
What are you doing, Bertrand?

18:24.260 --> 18:27.040
What are you doing, Bertrand-san?

18:27.310 --> 18:28.100
No.

18:28.100 --> 18:29.710
I am not Bertrand.

18:30.140 --> 18:33.040
You just said you were.

18:30.140 --> 18:33.040
You just called yourself that.

18:33.040 --> 18:35.940
The Bertrand you knew is dead!

18:35.940 --> 18:39.550
What you see here is a knight that has lost 
everything and has fallen into the abyss!

18:46.530 --> 18:48.430
Are you all right?

18:51.960 --> 18:53.250
Just end me.

18:53.250 --> 18:55.650
Doesn't look like you are.

18:55.650 --> 18:58.380
This body might as well be a corpse!

18:58.380 --> 19:00.460
It can no longer feel pain!

19:01.090 --> 19:03.740
Please kill me!

19:01.090 --> 19:03.740
There, there. Let's go back to the village.

19:03.740 --> 19:05.640
No! I have to die here!

19:05.640 --> 19:08.000
I don't want to go! No!

19:05.640 --> 19:08.000
Don't be difficult.

19:06.550 --> 19:09.140
Please take her away already.

19:09.910 --> 19:14.100
She won't shut up, and it's so annoying.

19:26.200 --> 19:28.740
You're so impatient.

19:30.290 --> 19:32.520
You know what my power is, right?

19:32.870 --> 19:35.860
I wouldn't risk making 
an in-person appearance.

19:36.960 --> 19:37.650
Loki...

19:37.960 --> 19:40.050
Gaia and Mitama-chan...

19:40.050 --> 19:43.340
What are you doing here with 
that team of rejects, Yukito?

19:45.260 --> 19:46.260
You're wrong!

19:46.260 --> 19:47.720
We're a reject couple!

19:47.720 --> 19:48.890
I'm not a reject!

19:48.890 --> 19:51.620
I have over 10,000 followers!

19:51.620 --> 19:53.390
Oh, impressive.

19:53.850 --> 19:56.750
I have over 1,120,000 followers, though.

19:56.750 --> 19:59.190
Oh, that's all?

19:59.190 --> 20:00.670
That's merely...

20:00.980 --> 20:02.690
One, ten...

20:02.690 --> 20:04.340
a h-hundred times what I have?

20:04.700 --> 20:07.780
That's right, you bottom feeding godling.

20:08.620 --> 20:11.200
Y-Yukito...

20:12.200 --> 20:13.910
This is unexpected.

20:13.910 --> 20:16.370
I didn't expect 1,120,000...

20:16.810 --> 20:19.980
I'm totally blindsided 
by how few you have.

20:23.710 --> 20:24.660
What?

20:25.220 --> 20:26.550
We're going home.

20:26.550 --> 20:29.140
Any further reconnaissance is unnecessary.

20:29.140 --> 20:30.160
Hey, wait.

20:30.510 --> 20:32.620
Loki, just one thing.

20:33.270 --> 20:36.020
If you had foolishly attacked us,

20:36.020 --> 20:37.340
you would have been dead.

20:47.780 --> 20:49.280
That was close.

20:49.280 --> 20:51.270
If we had foolishly attacked, 
we would have been dead.

20:51.270 --> 20:53.080
Huh? What?!

20:53.080 --> 20:54.700
You were just acting tough?!

20:54.700 --> 20:55.960
Of course I was.

20:55.960 --> 20:59.270
1,120,000 followers was 
completely unexpected.

20:59.270 --> 21:01.250
It's a miracle we were able to get away.

21:01.250 --> 21:03.740
Bottom feeding god...

21:01.670 --> 21:03.740
You're cute when you're depressed, too.

21:04.090 --> 21:06.260
Well, I'm glad we're all safe.

21:06.260 --> 21:08.570
And we got Bertrand-san back as well.

21:08.570 --> 21:11.430
Ber, please tell us about the 
situation inside the capital.

21:11.430 --> 21:13.700
Since you were inside, 
you're the only one we can count on.

21:14.020 --> 21:15.470
C-Count on?!

21:16.140 --> 21:18.560
After the Emperor had died,

21:18.560 --> 21:21.020
all order in the capital was lost.

21:21.020 --> 21:23.700
However, once Loki went 
inside the imperial palace,

21:23.700 --> 21:28.320
the people all started acting in an 
orderly fashion, like they used to.

21:28.320 --> 21:31.110
After that, I agreed to guard at the gates

21:31.110 --> 21:34.010
in return for being told 
what her plans are...

21:34.010 --> 21:37.890
But no matter how many times I asked,

21:37.890 --> 21:39.980
I was only sent away again and again.

21:39.790 --> 21:42.530
As soon as Loki went into 
the imperial palace, huh?

21:40.680 --> 21:42.530
I am so utterly useless.

21:42.530 --> 21:46.260
I guess Loki's acting as the Emperor.

21:46.260 --> 21:49.400
By using her illusion power 
on the entire capital.

21:51.510 --> 21:52.800
What?

21:52.800 --> 21:57.120
So that means she grabbed the entire 
population of the capital as her followers?

21:57.120 --> 21:59.570
I can't believe she turned the entire 
capital into a religious group.

21:59.570 --> 22:01.590
We can collect as many isolation camp 
villages as we want, and still...

22:01.590 --> 22:04.060
But she's making a mistake!

22:04.060 --> 22:04.760
Huh?

22:04.760 --> 22:07.310
She may have 1,120,000 followers,

22:07.310 --> 22:09.200
but those are the Emperor's followers.

22:09.200 --> 22:10.370
Not Loki's.

22:10.370 --> 22:12.280
That's where we can strike.

22:12.280 --> 22:13.890
This is not a game.

22:13.890 --> 22:15.390
This is a psychological war.

22:15.390 --> 22:17.410
So you have an idea!

22:17.410 --> 22:18.520
Nice, Yukito!

22:19.150 --> 22:21.190
Our first move to strike back is...

22:21.190 --> 22:23.090
Bottom-feeding god...

22:23.090 --> 22:26.110
Even as a bottom-feeder you're cute.

22:26.110 --> 22:28.780
I'll become the producer...

22:29.360 --> 22:32.700
for the next-gen song princess!

22:32.700 --> 22:33.990
Pro...

22:33.990 --> 22:34.730
...du...

22:34.730 --> 22:36.330
...cer?

22:37.310 --> 22:41.500
The goddess style idol, 
Mitama-chan, has descended!

23:35.140 --> 23:40.760
Episode 10
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
There is not a singl—
